        <briefdescription>
<para>Return the maximum number of bytes a single entity span can occupy. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Used by <ref refid="classthemis_1_1utils_1_1_p_i_i_stream_scanner" kindref="compound">PIIStreamScanner</ref> to size its cross-chunk lookahead buffer so that entity spans straddling a chunk boundary are detected correctly. The sliding-window overlap used for cross-chunk regex matching equals this value.</para>
